X:1
T:Galop Infernal
C:Jacques Offenbach, 1858
O:Orpheus in the Underworld (Orphee aux enfers), the Can-Can
N:Pitches and rhythm from two matching ABC transcriptions (J. Chambers,
N:trillian.mit.edu; T. Traub, terrytraub.org), checked against a sequenced
N:MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com track 79379). Grace notes left out.
N:The ABC files agree on the tune's own octave, which fits the recorder;
N:the MIDI doubles the B strain an octave up. Second ending of strain A
N:follows the ABC files (the MIDI plays F E F E D D D2 there).
